Package: schisma
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Schisma contributors <schisma@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libasound2t64 | libasound2, libudev1, libx11-6, libxi6, libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0, libvulkan1
Homepage: https://github.com/TheColby/schisma
Description: Standalone controller-first MPE software synthesizer
 Schisma is a stereo physical-modeling instrument with per-note MPE
 expression, Scala and KBM microtonal tuning, a graphical topology editor,
 professional metering, and CUDA, Metal, and CPU batch-compute backends.
